    "v_b173ac18b0371a42_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 466.758621,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九五四年春天，北京四中校门口，一个二十一岁的年轻人站在那里，手里攥着一张纸，纸上只有八个字，教学不力解除聘用。他叫陈景润，半年前刚从厦门大学数学系毕业，被分配到这所北京名校当数学老师。所有人都觉得名牌大学、高材生、教中学那还不是手到擒来，结果果第一堂课就翻了车。他是福建人口吟重的，像含着橄榄站在讲台上紧张的满脸通红，黑板上的公式写的工工整整，嘴里的话却结结巴巴。后排学生直接站起来喊老师，你能不能说清楚点。第一堂课下来，学生一头雾水，他自己出了一身大汗，家长投诉信像雪片一样飞进。学校叫他苦练了大半年，普通话没用，最后学校把他辞退了一个名牌大学的高材生，刚毕业就丢了饭碗，他卷着铺盖回了福州老家。街坊邻居指指点点，读了那么多年书，连个教书的活都干不明白。走投无路，他在福州街头摆了个小书摊儿，靠租书给路人看赚口饭吃。可谁能想到，就是这个被学生哄下台，被学校辞退，在街头摆书摊的失败者，十几年后，用挤麻袋草稿纸摘下了数学皇冠上的明珠，让整个欧美数学界集体闭嘴。今天咱们就讲讲陈景润，这个被全世界误解了一辈子的人。一九三三年，陈景润出生在福州一个普通职员家庭，家里兄弟姐妹多，日子紧巴巴他。十四岁那年，母亲走了，天塌了一半，从小他就体弱多病，性格闷，不爱说话，别的孩子在外面疯跑，他一个人蹲在墙角，啃数学书。同学欺负他，把螃蟹搁他课桌上，老师查下来，大家都推到他头上，他嘴笨，不会辩解，白挨了多少冤枉，没人跟他玩，没人理解他只有那些冷冰冰的数字，是他灰暗童年里唯一的光。初三那年，学校来了个数学老师，叫沈原清华大学航空系毕业的有一回上课，沈源随口说了个故事，世界上有一道难题叫哥德巴赫猜想，困扰了全世界数学家两百多年，就像数学皇冠上一颗够不着的明珠，谁摘下来，谁名垂青史，别的同学听完就忘了，可这句话像一颗火星子，啪的掉进了陈景润心里。他暗暗发誓，这辈子我非把这颗明珠摘下来不可。一九五零年，十七岁的陈景润高中都没毕业，就考上了厦门大学数学系，全班就四个人。他一头扎进书堆里，像饿了三天的人，扑在馒头上下大雨，同学都往屋檐下冲，就他一个人在校园里慢悠悠晃，脑子里全是公事，浑身淋透了才反应过来哟。下雨了，在厦大读了几年，他连一街之隔的鼓浪屿都没去过，一场电影都没看过。一九五三年提前毕业分配到北京四中，然后就是开头那一幕被辞退摆书摊。就在他人生最黑的时候，厦门大学校长王亚楠听说了这事儿，王亚楠是谁？资本论的中文译者，大经济学家，他专门从厦门跑到福州，一个下着冷雨的夜里，敲开了陈景润家的门。就说了一句，厦大需要你这样的人，就这一句话，把他从泥里拉了出来。王亚楠知道他不是教书的料，根本不让他上讲台，直接安排到数学系资料室整理图书。别人觉得这活枯燥，在陈景润眼里，这是天堂，没人兜扰，天天有最新的数学书看。就在资料室里，他翻到了华罗庚的堆垒粟，数论那本书厚的像砖头。他干脆一页一页拆下来，揣在兜里，走到哪儿读到哪儿，前前后后读了三十多遍，几乎整本背了下来。没多久，他写了篇论文，直接改进了华罗庚的成果，论文转到北京。华罗庚本人看完又惊又喜。厦门大学资料室里还藏着这么一号人物。一九五七年，二十四岁的陈景润被调入中国科学院数学研究所。所有人都以为进了中科院，总算能过上科学家的日子了，可现实又给了他一圈，给他安排的住处是一间旧厕所改的小屋，六平米，一张小床，一张窄书桌，床头就挨着马桶。夏天闷得像蒸笼，冬天寒风从墙缝缝里往里灌，冻得手，都握不住笔。他根本不在乎。每天清早打一壶开水，几个馒头钻进小屋，就是一整天门都很少出，屋里堆的满满当当全是草稿纸。前前后后攒了几麻袋，每张纸上都密密麻麻写满了公式。为了哥德巴赫猜想，他把之前的结论推翻了，重来，重来又推翻，不知道多少遍，身体越来越差，一年得住好几次院，科比停不下来，医生给他扎针，他特意叮嘱别扎右手，我还得写字。一九六六年，他在科学通报上宣布，我证明了一加二，可那是个特殊的年代，没人在意一个数学家说了什么，这个足以震动世界的成果，就这么悄无声息的沉了下去。整整七年，他一个人在那间，六平米的小屋里把证明一遍一遍，验算完善，没人知道他在干什么，没人理解他图什么。直到一九七三年，他把完整的证明发表在中国科学上。这一次，全世界都听到了一个被学校辞退，在街头摆书摊的年轻人，用挤麻袋草稿纸，让全世界对中国数学刮目相看。如果你也被他的故事打动了，麻烦点个赞，在评论区留下一句致敬陈景润，再转发给身边的朋友，让更多人知道这个名字，关注我。下集接着讲他成名之后发生了什么，以及他生命，最后那些让人心疼的日子。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 1530,
      "text": "一九五四年春天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1810,
      "end_ms": 3210,
      "text": "北京四中校门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3630,
      "end_ms": 6270,
      "text": "一个二十一岁的年轻人站在那里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6570,
      "end_ms": 7990,
      "text": "手里攥着一张纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8490,
      "end_ms": 9970,
      "text": "纸上只有八个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10410,
      "end_ms": 12670,
      "text": "教学不力解除聘用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13370,
      "end_ms": 14470,
      "text": "他叫陈景润，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14910,
      "end_ms": 17870,
      "text": "半年前刚从厦门大学数学系毕业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18290,
      "end_ms": 22110,
      "text": "被分配到这所北京名校当数学老师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22910,
      "end_ms": 28610,
      "text": "所有人都觉得名牌大学、高材生、教中学那还不是手到擒来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28610,
      "end_ms": 31900,
      "text": "结果果第一堂课就翻了车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00012",
      "start_ms": 32900,
      "end_ms": 35260,
      "text": "他是福建人口吟重的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35260,
      "end_ms": 39620,
      "text": "像含着橄榄站在讲台上紧张的满脸通红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00014",
      "start_ms": 40160,
      "end_ms": 42860,
      "text": "黑板上的公式写的工工整整，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00015",
      "start_ms": 43100,
      "end_ms": 44940,
      "text": "嘴里的话却结结巴巴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00016",
      "start_ms": 45480,
      "end_ms": 48360,
      "text": "后排学生直接站起来喊老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48780,
      "end_ms": 50220,
      "text": "你能不能说清楚点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50820,
      "end_ms": 51900,
      "text": "第一堂课下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00019",
      "start_ms": 52120,
      "end_ms": 53320,
      "text": "学生一头雾水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00020",
      "start_ms": 54120,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "他自己出了一身大汗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00021",
      "start_ms": 56800,
      "end_ms": 59640,
      "text": "家长投诉信像雪片一样飞进。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00022",
      "start_ms": 59640,
      "end_ms": 62220,
      "text": "学校叫他苦练了大半年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00023",
      "start_ms": 62220,
      "end_ms": 63535,
      "text": "普通话没用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00024",
      "start_ms": 64080,
      "end_ms": 68515,
      "text": "最后学校把他辞退了一个名牌大学的高材生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68830,
      "end_ms": 70465,
      "text": "刚毕业就丢了饭碗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71320,
      "end_ms": 73860,
      "text": "他卷着铺盖回了福州老家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73960,
      "end_ms": 75465,
      "text": "街坊邻居指指点点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75710,
      "end_ms": 76930,
      "text": "读了那么多年书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00029",
      "start_ms": 77210,
      "end_ms": 79255,
      "text": "连个教书的活都干不明白。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80190,
      "end_ms": 81045,
      "text": "走投无路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00031",
      "start_ms": 81720,
      "end_ms": 83915,
      "text": "他在福州街头摆了个小书摊儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00032",
      "start_ms": 84490,
      "end_ms": 87775,
      "text": "靠租书给路人看赚口饭吃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00033",
      "start_ms": 88130,
      "end_ms": 89075,
      "text": "可谁能想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00034",
      "start_ms": 89550,
      "end_ms": 91330,
      "text": "就是这个被学生哄下台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00035",
      "start_ms": 91690,
      "end_ms": 92870,
      "text": "被学校辞退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00036",
      "start_ms": 93310,
      "end_ms": 95575,
      "text": "在街头摆书摊的失败者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00037",
      "start_ms": 95980,
      "end_ms": 96915,
      "text": "十几年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00038",
      "start_ms": 97360,
      "end_ms": 102155,
      "text": "用挤麻袋草稿纸摘下了数学皇冠上的明珠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00039",
      "start_ms": 102710,
      "end_ms": 105685,
      "text": "让整个欧美数学界集体闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00040",
      "start_ms": 106620,
      "end_ms": 109195,
      "text": "今天咱们就讲讲陈景润，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00041",
      "start_ms": 110190,
      "end_ms": 112835,
      "text": "这个被全世界误解了一辈子的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00042",
      "start_ms": 113080,
      "end_ms": 114080,
      "text": "一九三三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00043",
      "start_ms": 114300,
      "end_ms": 117675,
      "text": "陈景润出生在福州一个普通职员家庭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00044",
      "start_ms": 118250,
      "end_ms": 119630,
      "text": "家里兄弟姐妹多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00045",
      "start_ms": 119850,
      "end_ms": 121510,
      "text": "日子紧巴巴他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00046",
      "start_ms": 121510,
      "end_ms": 122530,
      "text": "十四岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00047",
      "start_ms": 122710,
      "end_ms": 123675,
      "text": "母亲走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00048",
      "start_ms": 123950,
      "end_ms": 124865,
      "text": "天塌了一半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00049",
      "start_ms": 125440,
      "end_ms": 127160,
      "text": "从小他就体弱多病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00050",
      "start_ms": 127420,
      "end_ms": 128335,
      "text": "性格闷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00051",
      "start_ms": 128640,
      "end_ms": 129535,
      "text": "不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00052",
      "start_ms": 129990,
      "end_ms": 131665,
      "text": "别的孩子在外面疯跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00053",
      "start_ms": 132050,
      "end_ms": 133650,
      "text": "他一个人蹲在墙角，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00054",
      "start_ms": 133730,
      "end_ms": 134735,
      "text": "啃数学书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00055",
      "start_ms": 135190,
      "end_ms": 136170,
      "text": "同学欺负他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136390,
      "end_ms": 138225,
      "text": "把螃蟹搁他课桌上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00057",
      "start_ms": 138720,
      "end_ms": 139740,
      "text": "老师查下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00058",
      "start_ms": 139980,
      "end_ms": 141380,
      "text": "大家都推到他头上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00059",
      "start_ms": 141540,
      "end_ms": 142305,
      "text": "他嘴笨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00060",
      "start_ms": 142620,
      "end_ms": 143420,
      "text": "不会辩解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00061",
      "start_ms": 143720,
      "end_ms": 145080,
      "text": "白挨了多少冤枉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00062",
      "start_ms": 145260,
      "end_ms": 146200,
      "text": "没人跟他玩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00063",
      "start_ms": 146280,
      "end_ms": 149465,
      "text": "没人理解他只有那些冷冰冰的数字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00064",
      "start_ms": 149880,
      "end_ms": 152145,
      "text": "是他灰暗童年里唯一的光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00065",
      "start_ms": 152800,
      "end_ms": 153755,
      "text": "初三那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00066",
      "start_ms": 154150,
      "end_ms": 155805,
      "text": "学校来了个数学老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00067",
      "start_ms": 156470,
      "end_ms": 161290,
      "text": "叫沈原清华大学航空系毕业的有一回上课，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00068",
      "start_ms": 161550,
      "end_ms": 163285,
      "text": "沈源随口说了个故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00069",
      "start_ms": 163780,
      "end_ms": 167635,
      "text": "世界上有一道难题叫哥德巴赫猜想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00070",
      "start_ms": 168010,
      "end_ms": 170985,
      "text": "困扰了全世界数学家两百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00071",
      "start_ms": 171550,
      "end_ms": 174475,
      "text": "就像数学皇冠上一颗够不着的明珠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00072",
      "start_ms": 174900,
      "end_ms": 175760,
      "text": "谁摘下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00073",
      "start_ms": 176020,
      "end_ms": 177485,
      "text": "谁名垂青史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00074",
      "start_ms": 178350,
      "end_ms": 180045,
      "text": "别的同学听完就忘了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00075",
      "start_ms": 181240,
      "end_ms": 183575,
      "text": "可这句话像一颗火星子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00076",
      "start_ms": 183960,
      "end_ms": 186135,
      "text": "啪的掉进了陈景润心里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00077",
      "start_ms": 186400,
      "end_ms": 187635,
      "text": "他暗暗发誓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00078",
      "start_ms": 188010,
      "end_ms": 191485,
      "text": "这辈子我非把这颗明珠摘下来不可。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00079",
      "start_ms": 192500,
      "end_ms": 193520,
      "text": "一九五零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00080",
      "start_ms": 193820,
      "end_ms": 197055,
      "text": "十七岁的陈景润高中都没毕业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00081",
      "start_ms": 197730,
      "end_ms": 200695,
      "text": "就考上了厦门大学数学系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00082",
      "start_ms": 201580,
      "end_ms": 202825,
      "text": "全班就四个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00083",
      "start_ms": 203690,
      "end_ms": 205515,
      "text": "他一头扎进书堆里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00084",
      "start_ms": 206190,
      "end_ms": 207670,
      "text": "像饿了三天的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00085",
      "start_ms": 207710,
      "end_ms": 210055,
      "text": "扑在馒头上下大雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00086",
      "start_ms": 210440,
      "end_ms": 212375,
      "text": "同学都往屋檐下冲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00087",
      "start_ms": 213090,
      "end_ms": 215450,
      "text": "就他一个人在校园里慢悠悠晃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00088",
      "start_ms": 215750,
      "end_ms": 217285,
      "text": "脑子里全是公事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00089",
      "start_ms": 217690,
      "end_ms": 219805,
      "text": "浑身淋透了才反应过来哟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00090",
      "start_ms": 221450,
      "end_ms": 222105,
      "text": "下雨了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00091",
      "start_ms": 223310,
      "end_ms": 224805,
      "text": "在厦大读了几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00092",
      "start_ms": 225130,
      "end_ms": 228195,
      "text": "他连一街之隔的鼓浪屿都没去过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00093",
      "start_ms": 228640,
      "end_ms": 230365,
      "text": "一场电影都没看过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00094",
      "start_ms": 232040,
      "end_ms": 236025,
      "text": "一九五三年提前毕业分配到北京四中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00095",
      "start_ms": 236490,
      "end_ms": 241130,
      "text": "然后就是开头那一幕被辞退摆书摊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00096",
      "start_ms": 241650,
      "end_ms": 243690,
      "text": "就在他人生最黑的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00097",
      "start_ms": 244090,
      "end_ms": 247710,
      "text": "厦门大学校长王亚楠听说了这事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00098",
      "start_ms": 248150,
      "end_ms": 249070,
      "text": "王亚楠是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00099",
      "start_ms": 249390,
      "end_ms": 251050,
      "text": "资本论的中文译者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00100",
      "start_ms": 251470,
      "end_ms": 252550,
      "text": "大经济学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00101",
      "start_ms": 252910,
      "end_ms": 255850,
      "text": "他专门从厦门跑到福州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00102",
      "start_ms": 256290,
      "end_ms": 258330,
      "text": "一个下着冷雨的夜里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00103",
      "start_ms": 258330,
      "end_ms": 260030,
      "text": "敲开了陈景润家的门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00104",
      "start_ms": 260430,
      "end_ms": 261290,
      "text": "就说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00105",
      "start_ms": 261770,
      "end_ms": 263490,
      "text": "厦大需要你这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00106",
      "start_ms": 264050,
      "end_ms": 265050,
      "text": "就这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00107",
      "start_ms": 265290,
      "end_ms": 267030,
      "text": "把他从泥里拉了出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00108",
      "start_ms": 267530,
      "end_ms": 270180,
      "text": "王亚楠知道他不是教书的料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00109",
      "start_ms": 270920,
      "end_ms": 272620,
      "text": "根本不让他上讲台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00110",
      "start_ms": 272920,
      "end_ms": 276440,
      "text": "直接安排到数学系资料室整理图书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00111",
      "start_ms": 277120,
      "end_ms": 278720,
      "text": "别人觉得这活枯燥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00112",
      "start_ms": 279140,
      "end_ms": 280700,
      "text": "在陈景润眼里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00113",
      "start_ms": 281120,
      "end_ms": 282000,
      "text": "这是天堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00114",
      "start_ms": 282600,
      "end_ms": 283560,
      "text": "没人兜扰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00115",
      "start_ms": 283920,
      "end_ms": 286080,
      "text": "天天有最新的数学书看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00116",
      "start_ms": 286720,
      "end_ms": 287980,
      "text": "就在资料室里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00117",
      "start_ms": 288100,
      "end_ms": 290620,
      "text": "他翻到了华罗庚的堆垒粟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00118",
      "start_ms": 290720,
      "end_ms": 293660,
      "text": "数论那本书厚的像砖头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00119",
      "start_ms": 293680,
      "end_ms": 295840,
      "text": "他干脆一页一页拆下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00120",
      "start_ms": 295840,
      "end_ms": 297460,
      "text": "揣在兜里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00121",
      "start_ms": 297460,
      "end_ms": 299955,
      "text": "走到哪儿读到哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00122",
      "start_ms": 300690,
      "end_ms": 302875,
      "text": "前前后后读了三十多遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00123",
      "start_ms": 303620,
      "end_ms": 305795,
      "text": "几乎整本背了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00124",
      "start_ms": 306870,
      "end_ms": 307510,
      "text": "没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00125",
      "start_ms": 307690,
      "end_ms": 308950,
      "text": "他写了篇论文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00126",
      "start_ms": 309470,
      "end_ms": 311690,
      "text": "直接改进了华罗庚的成果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00127",
      "start_ms": 312490,
      "end_ms": 313670,
      "text": "论文转到北京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00128",
      "start_ms": 314090,
      "end_ms": 316470,
      "text": "华罗庚本人看完又惊又喜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00129",
      "start_ms": 316990,
      "end_ms": 320255,
      "text": "厦门大学资料室里还藏着这么一号人物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00130",
      "start_ms": 322280,
      "end_ms": 323280,
      "text": "一九五七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00131",
      "start_ms": 323760,
      "end_ms": 328500,
      "text": "二十四岁的陈景润被调入中国科学院数学研究所。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00132",
      "start_ms": 329160,
      "end_ms": 331660,
      "text": "所有人都以为进了中科院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00133",
      "start_ms": 332040,
      "end_ms": 334420,
      "text": "总算能过上科学家的日子了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00134",
      "start_ms": 334480,
      "end_ms": 336320,
      "text": "可现实又给了他一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00135",
      "start_ms": 337080,
      "end_ms": 341000,
      "text": "给他安排的住处是一间旧厕所改的小屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00136",
      "start_ms": 341860,
      "end_ms": 342620,
      "text": "六平米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00137",
      "start_ms": 342780,
      "end_ms": 343620,
      "text": "一张小床，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00138",
      "start_ms": 343980,
      "end_ms": 345120,
      "text": "一张窄书桌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00139",
      "start_ms": 345800,
      "end_ms": 347640,
      "text": "床头就挨着马桶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00140",
      "start_ms": 348480,
      "end_ms": 349980,
      "text": "夏天闷得像蒸笼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00141",
      "start_ms": 350460,
      "end_ms": 352990,
      "text": "冬天寒风从墙缝缝里往里灌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00142",
      "start_ms": 353430,
      "end_ms": 354150,
      "text": "冻得手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00143",
      "start_ms": 354190,
      "end_ms": 355090,
      "text": "都握不住笔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00144",
      "start_ms": 355430,
      "end_ms": 356630,
      "text": "他根本不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00145",
      "start_ms": 357170,
      "end_ms": 359390,
      "text": "每天清早打一壶开水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00146",
      "start_ms": 359750,
      "end_ms": 361790,
      "text": "几个馒头钻进小屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00147",
      "start_ms": 361790,
      "end_ms": 364330,
      "text": "就是一整天门都很少出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00148",
      "start_ms": 364590,
      "end_ms": 367535,
      "text": "屋里堆的满满当当全是草稿纸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00149",
      "start_ms": 367850,
      "end_ms": 369810,
      "text": "前前后后攒了几麻袋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00150",
      "start_ms": 370210,
      "end_ms": 373090,
      "text": "每张纸上都密密麻麻写满了公式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00151",
      "start_ms": 373290,
      "end_ms": 374895,
      "text": "为了哥德巴赫猜想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00152",
      "start_ms": 375170,
      "end_ms": 377350,
      "text": "他把之前的结论推翻了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00153",
      "start_ms": 377350,
      "end_ms": 378025,
      "text": "重来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00154",
      "start_ms": 378460,
      "end_ms": 379645,
      "text": "重来又推翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00155",
      "start_ms": 380000,
      "end_ms": 381075,
      "text": "不知道多少遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00156",
      "start_ms": 381800,
      "end_ms": 383105,
      "text": "身体越来越差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00157",
      "start_ms": 383440,
      "end_ms": 385215,
      "text": "一年得住好几次院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00158",
      "start_ms": 385670,
      "end_ms": 386825,
      "text": "科比停不下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00159",
      "start_ms": 387450,
      "end_ms": 388530,
      "text": "医生给他扎针，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00160",
      "start_ms": 388690,
      "end_ms": 391060,
      "text": "他特意叮嘱别扎右手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00161",
      "start_ms": 391200,
      "end_ms": 392275,
      "text": "我还得写字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00162",
      "start_ms": 393120,
      "end_ms": 394140,
      "text": "一九六六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00163",
      "start_ms": 394360,
      "end_ms": 396440,
      "text": "他在科学通报上宣布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00164",
      "start_ms": 396780,
      "end_ms": 398895,
      "text": "我证明了一加二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00165",
      "start_ms": 399900,
      "end_ms": 401725,
      "text": "可那是个特殊的年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00166",
      "start_ms": 402140,
      "end_ms": 404915,
      "text": "没人在意一个数学家说了什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00167",
      "start_ms": 405310,
      "end_ms": 408025,
      "text": "这个足以震动世界的成果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00168",
      "start_ms": 408430,
      "end_ms": 411010,
      "text": "就这么悄无声息的沉了下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00169",
      "start_ms": 411130,
      "end_ms": 412185,
      "text": "整整七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00170",
      "start_ms": 412610,
      "end_ms": 414310,
      "text": "他一个人在那间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00171",
      "start_ms": 414310,
      "end_ms": 417950,
      "text": "六平米的小屋里把证明一遍一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00172",
      "start_ms": 417970,
      "end_ms": 419335,
      "text": "验算完善，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00173",
      "start_ms": 419880,
      "end_ms": 421545,
      "text": "没人知道他在干什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00174",
      "start_ms": 421790,
      "end_ms": 423275,
      "text": "没人理解他图什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00175",
      "start_ms": 424960,
      "end_ms": 426425,
      "text": "直到一九七三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00176",
      "start_ms": 426860,
      "end_ms": 429860,
      "text": "他把完整的证明发表在中国科学上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00177",
      "start_ms": 430300,
      "end_ms": 430940,
      "text": "这一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00178",
      "start_ms": 431240,
      "end_ms": 435240,
      "text": "全世界都听到了一个被学校辞退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00179",
      "start_ms": 435680,
      "end_ms": 438300,
      "text": "在街头摆书摊的年轻人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00180",
      "start_ms": 438680,
      "end_ms": 440880,
      "text": "用挤麻袋草稿纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00181",
      "start_ms": 441460,
      "end_ms": 444100,
      "text": "让全世界对中国数学刮目相看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00182",
      "start_ms": 444780,
      "end_ms": 446800,
      "text": "如果你也被他的故事打动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00183",
      "start_ms": 446960,
      "end_ms": 447880,
      "text": "麻烦点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00184",
      "start_ms": 447900,
      "end_ms": 450800,
      "text": "在评论区留下一句致敬陈景润，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00185",
      "start_ms": 451420,
      "end_ms": 453260,
      "text": "再转发给身边的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00186",
      "start_ms": 453740,
      "end_ms": 456105,
      "text": "让更多人知道这个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00187",
      "start_ms": 456790,
      "end_ms": 457410,
      "text": "关注我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00188",
      "start_ms": 457710,
      "end_ms": 461770,
      "text": "下集接着讲他成名之后发生了什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00189",
      "start_ms": 462210,
      "end_ms": 463790,
      "text": "以及他生命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b173ac18b0371a42_s00190",
      "start_ms": 463930,
      "end_ms": 466675,
      "text": "最后那些让人心疼的日子。"
    }
  ],
